===========================================================================

The VUURWERK-original features, algorithms, and modules enumerated in this
document ("VUURWERK-original contributions", the list headed
"VUURWERK-original contributions (designed and conceived by James
Honiball)") are licensed AS A PACKAGE, solely as part of the complete
VUURWERK firmware, under GPL v3.

They are NOT individually free to take. Extracting any single
VUURWERK-original contribution from this repository, porting it to another
firmware, platform, or radio, incorporating it into a separate project
(open source or otherwise), or using it in any commercial product is NOT
licensed by this repository's public availability. Each of those uses
requires a separate COMMERCIAL LICENSE granted in writing by James
Honiball (KC3TFZ). See the Dual-Licensing Notice below for the full terms.

Want to use a VUURWERK-original feature outside the complete VUURWERK
firmware? Ask first: jhoniball4@gmail.com

Forking, building, modifying, and redistributing the COMPLETE VUURWERK
firmware under GPL v3 terms remains free, as stated below.

